`src/foscar/wrapper.py`, `src/foscar/_sm100/gqa_decode.py` and
`src/foscar/_sm100/int_fold_decode.py` are adapted from FlashInfer's CuTe DSL
attention modules (https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer). FlashInfer is
published under the Apache License 2.0, and the files these three derive from
carry NVIDIA's copyright and the BSD 3-Clause License reproduced below, which is
the license this material is under.

Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
Copyright 2025-2026 NVIDIA, Copyright 2023-2026 FlashInfer community.

Changes from the upstream work: every decode path was replaced with a quantized
one; the dense attention pipeline, the paged K/V gather, the flash-decoding
split-K reduction and the arch dispatch were rewritten; and the upstream
API-logging decorator and SM-count helper were replaced with local equivalents.

